---
import PortfolioGrid from '@components/PortfolioGrid.astro';
---
<section class="work" id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="work-head"><div><div class="chapter-label mono"><span class="b"></span>V / WORK</div><h2 class="chapter-title serif">Proof, not a<br/><em>portfolio wall.</em></h2></div><p class="portfolio-lede">Four selected directions. See the full collection for websites, studio ventures and business-card design.</p></div><PortfolioGrid teaser /><p class="portfolio-all"><a href="/work/">See all selected work →</a></p></div></section>
<style>.portfolio-lede{max-width:38ch;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-muted)}.portfolio-all{text-align:center;padding-top:40px}.portfolio-all a{font:12px/1.6 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--accent-4);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:8px}</style>
